but then that guy from the train

248
00:09:08.673 --> 00:09:10.050
baited me into blabbing
about you.

249
00:09:10.133 --> 00:09:11.652
and he turned out
to be a goddamn robot!

250
00:09:11.676 --> 00:09:13.344
That is why I keep quiet.

251
00:09:13.386 --> 00:09:14.888
Oh. you're such a butt!

252
00:09:14.971 --> 00:09:16.181
I'll figure it out on my own.

253
00:09:16.264 --> 00:09:17.682
Doubt it.
Ugh!

254
00:09:17.766 --> 00:09:20.185
Ugh! You know. O'Doyle
always carries his own bodies.

255
00:09:20.268 --> 00:09:22.145
Sometimes he carries me. too.
Piggyback.

256
00:09:22.187 --> 00:09:24.481
Right on time.
Come on. shove it inside.

257
00:09:27.484 --> 00:09:29.486
Jesus.
Had to contain the scent.

258
00:09:30.278 --> 00:09:32.822
Haha! Yep! None of the
pheromones got airborne. sir.

259
00:09:32.864 --> 00:09:34.282
This party is clear.

260
00:09:34.365 --> 00:09:37.827
Well. just in case.
I'm bringing some nuance.

261
00:09:37.869 --> 00:09:40.371
You're still not using
that word right. sir.

262
00:09:40.455 --> 00:09:41.790
Honestly. I still can't believe

263
00:09:41.873 --> 00:09:43.665
you reformed
the Rockford Babysitter Eater.

264
00:09:43.708 --> 00:09:45.043
Eh.
Wasn't that hard.

265
00:09:45.126 --> 00:09:46.395
Just had to find
the right synthetic flesh

266
00:09:46.419 --> 00:09:47.796
for his skin suits.

267
00:09:47.837 --> 00:09:49.339
And I thought I was
a picky dresser.

268
00:09:49.380 --> 00:09:52.217
Ah. Mr. President.
Noticing a lot of rizz tonight.

269
00:09:52.258 --> 00:09:54.135
Oh. stop it. senator.

270
00:09:54.219 --> 00:09:55.929
Andre. you know
Candyman? Of course!

271
00:09:56.012 --> 00:09:58.723
I see you've replaced your hook
with a champagne flute.

272
00:09:58.807 --> 00:10:00.934
Why would I want
a glass container as a hand?

273
00:10:01.017 --> 00:10:03.186
It's a champagne flute holder.

274
00:10:03.228 --> 00:10:05.939
I'm sure that distinction
is important to you.

275
00:10:06.022 --> 00:10:07.232
It is.

276
00:10:07.982 --> 00:10:09.567
Uh. I'm sorry.
What am I doing?

277
00:10:09.651 --> 00:10:12.403
I'm sniping.
No. no. I got defensive.

278
00:10:12.445 --> 00:10:13.905
You brought up my hand.

279
00:10:13.988 --> 00:10:15.716
and it took me right back
to the bathroom mirror.

280
00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:17.742
Here.
Let... Let me top you off.

281
00:10:17.826 --> 00:10:19.285
To Beverly.
To Beverly.

282
00:10:19.369 --> 00:10:21.454
You know. I never would
have gotten into politics

283
00:10:21.538 --> 00:10:23.081
without her guidance?
Oh. please.

284
00:10:23.123 --> 00:10:25.333
I took you as my date
to one political fundraiser.

285
00:10:25.416 --> 00:10:27.210
Your charm did the rest.

286
00:10:27.252 --> 00:10:28.461
Who? Little old me?

287
00:10:31.172 --> 00:10:32.590
I gotta step out for a call.

288
00:10:32.674 --> 00:10:34.467
but. hey.
tonight's not about me.

289
00:10:34.551 --> 00:10:36.594
Bev. the floor is yours.

290
00:10:37.262 --> 00:10:39.597
Why are you here?
You're a dead man!

291
00:10:39.639 --> 00:10:40.849
Chomps! Bag him!

292
00:10:40.932 --> 00:10:42.600
I... I'm trying
to get a clear shot!

293
00:10:44.394 --> 00:10:45.311
Aah!

294
00:10:47.313 --> 00:10:48.940
Hya!

295
00:10:55.864 --> 00:10:59.784
Now do you believe me? Both of those guys
were servers. too. What does that prove?

296
00:10:59.826 --> 00:11:01.828
Other than your ex-wife
gives jobs to werewolves.

297
00:11:01.911 --> 00:11:04.164
and every time you see them.
you escalate things.

298
00:11:04.247 --> 00:11:05.498
Don't patronize me.

299
00:11:05.582 --> 00:11:08.585
Job Evaluation Help Desk.
How may I help you?

300
00:11:08.626 --> 00:11:10.211
Hi. there.
I'd like to restart my test.

301
00:11:10.295 --> 00:11:12.297
You and everyone
else here. ma'am. Right.

302
00:11:12.338 --> 00:11:14.966
Except I wasn't aware
you would be planting "Tom"

303
00:11:15.008 --> 00:11:17.135
to gaslight me into talking.

304
00:11:17.177 --> 00:11:20.388
What? No! I'm not snitching.
I'm just telling you about...

305
00:11:20.471 --> 00:11:21.931
Goddammit!

306
00:11:21.973 --> 00:11:23.808
Hey. Mary. I think she's
right. What the fuck?

307
00:11:23.892 --> 00:11:25.143
Get out of here. Tom.
No. no.

308
00:11:25.185 --> 00:11:26.728
You wanted to restart your test.

309
00:11:26.811 --> 00:11:28.411
and I think this might be
a special case.

310
00:11:28.438 --> 00:11:30.124
Of course it's a special case.

311
00:11:30.148 --> 00:11:31.774
Elitist?!
You know what?

312
00:11:31.816 --> 00:11:33.526
I tried to do this
the honest way.

313
00:11:33.610 --> 00:11:34.819
Diagnostic Mode.

314
00:11:37.655 --> 00:11:40.158
And... there we go.

315
00:11:40.200 --> 00:11:41.326
Clean reset.

316
00:11:41.409 --> 00:11:43.161
Resume functionality.

317
00:11:43.203 --> 00:11:46.831
What? I'm... supposed to talk
with the Chief of Staff?

318
00:11:46.915 --> 00:11:48.499
Do some kind of...
entrapment?

319
00:11:48.583 --> 00:11:50.210
Uh. excuse me.

320
00:11:50.293 --> 00:11:52.605
I keep getting dinged for trying
to have sex with the robots.

321
00:11:52.629 --> 00:11:54.464
Which robots do I complain to?

322
00:11:54.505 --> 00:11:55.840
These robots.

323
00:11:55.924 --> 00:11:58.009
Oh. my God. I'm a robot?!

324
00:11:58.092 --> 00:11:59.928
Oh. my God. I'm a robot?!

325
00:12:00.011 --> 00:12:01.888
Oh. my God. I'm a robot?!

326
00:12:01.971 --> 00:12:04.182
I'm a robot?! Oh.
my God. I'm a robot?!

327
00:12:04.265 --> 00:12:07.227
I have memory. but no memories!

328
00:12:07.310 --> 00:12:08.186
Ha!
Aah!

329
00:12:08.269 --> 00:12:10.021
Diagnostic Mode!
Diagnostic Mode!

330
00:12:12.523 --> 00:12:13.524
Aw!

331
00:12:13.566 --> 00:12:14.566
O'Doyle!

332
00:12:14.609 --> 00:12:15.860
Aw!

333
00:12:15.902 --> 00:12:17.403
Aw. come on. man!

334
00:12:17.487 --> 00:12:20.031
Now. most of you know this.
but I grew up here.

335
00:12:20.073 --> 00:12:21.908
and even though
I'm moving to the capital.

336
00:12:21.991 --> 00:12:24.160
I'll always be a Windy City kid.

337
00:12:24.202 --> 00:12:26.663
Feel that wind!
I love you. Chicago!

338
00:12:26.704 --> 00:12:28.206
I love you. Candyman!

339
00:12:28.248 --> 00:12:30.541
And I love you. Wrigley Gum!

340
00:12:30.625 --> 00:12:32.168
-Whoo!
-Wrigley!

341
00:12:32.210 --> 00:12:34.212
If I could vote for you
twice. I would.

342
00:12:34.295 --> 00:12:36.798
That'd be illegal.
But... kind of hot.

343
00:12:36.839 --> 00:12:39.676
Governor. the press
photographer is all set up for you.

344
00:12:39.717 --> 00:12:41.636
You ready?
For pictures? No.

345
00:12:41.719 --> 00:12:43.388
I'm shy.
Mm-hmm.

346
00:12:43.429 --> 00:12:46.140
Oh. that's nice.
Eyes up here. guys. Big smiles.

347
00:12:46.182 --> 00:12:48.768
Oh. Candyman. get that
champagne flute hand up for me.

348
00:12:48.851 --> 00:12:51.437
It's a champagne flute holder.

349
00:12:55.817 --> 00:12:57.485
Ladies and gentlemen.

350
00:12:57.527 --> 00:13:00.405
you are now prisoners in a
highly planned werewolf attack.

351
00:13:00.446 --> 00:13:03.825
All of
the servers were in on it.

352
00:13:03.908 --> 00:13:05.952
Yeah! I knew it!
I told you. Chomps.

353
00:13:06.035 --> 00:13:07.662
I killed three of them already.

354
00:13:07.745 --> 00:13:08.788
You did what now?

355
00:13:08.871 --> 00:13:11.249
Oh. Right. Uh...

356
00:13:11.291 --> 00:13:12.417
Shit.

357
00:13:13.960 --> 00:13:16.379
We are the Werewolf Anonymous.

358
00:13:16.421 --> 00:13:18.131
We've placed an EMP field
around the block.

359
00:13:18.214 --> 00:13:20.008
Your technology is useless.

360
00:13:20.091 --> 00:13:21.759
He's right.
Pheromone tracker is dead.

361
00:13:21.801 --> 00:13:24.679
What the hell. guys? You were
killing werewolves at my party?

362
00:13:24.721 --> 00:13:27.181
I told you we should
tell her. It's true. ma'am.

363
00:13:27.265 --> 00:13:28.808
He wanted to.
but I thought telling you

364
00:13:28.891 --> 00:13:30.226
might ruin his chances.

365
00:13:30.268 --> 00:13:31.620
because he's still
in love with you and...

366
00:13:31.644 --> 00:13:33.313
Chomps!
What the fuck. man?

367
00:13:33.396 --> 00:13:36.441
Uh. excuse me. I'm trying to do
a werewolf manifesto here.

368
00:13:36.524 --> 00:13:38.109
Oh. shut up. motherfucker!

369
00:13:38.192 --> 00:13:40.153
Also. you can't be anonymous
and have a manifesto.

370
00:13:40.236 --> 00:13:42.739
Pick a lane. I... I
can't take it anymore!

371
00:13:42.780 --> 00:13:44.324
I'm not a brave man!

372
00:13:45.616 --> 00:13:47.160
-Aah! Aah!
-My God.

373
00:13:47.243 --> 00:13:49.054
The bastards rigged the door
with werewolf teeth.

374
00:13:49.078 --> 00:13:50.538
Can you feel it. senator.

375
00:13:50.580 --> 00:13:53.499
our power coursing
through your veins?

376
00:13:53.583 --> 00:13:56.127
And she's trying
to take that from us!

377
00:13:56.169 --> 00:13:58.421
We don't need to be cured.
We like crime!

378
00:13:58.463 --> 00:14:02.133
Some werewolves got bit
and want a second chance.

379
00:14:02.175 --> 00:14:05.720
Not everyone who was dealt a
mouth of bees chooses darkness.

380
00:14:05.803 --> 00:14:07.305
Shut up. Candyman!

381
00:14:07.388 --> 00:14:09.766
Look at you.
a champagne flute for a hand.

382
00:14:09.807 --> 00:14:12.060
It's a champagne flute holder!

383
00:14:12.101 --> 00:14:14.812
It's the same thing. you cuck!
You sold out.

384
00:14:14.896 --> 00:14:16.189
I'm fucking Candyman!

385
00:14:16.272 --> 00:14:17.607
I pay more taxes than you.

386
00:14:17.648 --> 00:14:19.359
and I can drink
all the champagne I want.

387
00:14:19.442 --> 00:14:21.611
That doesn't make me spineless.
It makes me awesome!

388
00:14:21.652 --> 00:14:25.323
Enough! Beverly. we left a gift
on the center table.

389
00:14:25.365 --> 00:14:27.617
Use that to transfer all funds

390
00:14:27.658 --> 00:14:30.495
from your MoonRight program
to us.

391
00:14:30.536 --> 00:14:33.373
And if you don't.
you can all join us.

392
00:14:33.456 --> 00:14:36.042
Oh. my God. a bomb
covered in werewolf teeth?!

393
00:14:36.125 --> 00:14:37.502
You sick bastards!

394
00:14:37.585 --> 00:14:40.171
You have 20 minutes. Beverly.

395
00:14:40.838 --> 00:14:41.923
Aah!

396
00:14:42.006 --> 00:14:43.633
What the hell is going on?

397
00:14:43.674 --> 00:14:46.552
Erasing my score voided out
memories across multiple robots.

398
00:14:46.636 --> 00:14:49.180
That glitch set off a
universal programming collapse.

399
00:14:49.263 --> 00:14:51.516
I found another special case!

400
00:14:52.308 --> 00:14:53.869
You know what?
I don't like trains anyway.

401
00:14:53.893 --> 00:14:55.686
How do you feel about tunnels?

402
00:14:55.728 --> 00:14:57.355
Humans! I found humans!

403
00:14:57.438 --> 00:14:59.190
Move! Get inside.
There they are!

404
00:15:12.912 --> 00:15:13.996
Huh?

405
00:15:20.545 --> 00:15:21.796
Mm.

406
00:15:23.548 --> 00:15:25.716
Is that the gun baby?

407
00:15:25.800 --> 00:15:28.553
Why are you rescuing it?
Because I am gun baby!

408
00:15:29.637 --> 00:15:31.055
Searching for humans.

409
00:15:31.139 --> 00:15:32.739
You don't have to say it
out loud. Tommy.

410
00:15:32.765 --> 00:15:33.766
We're all searching.

411
00:15:35.560 --> 00:15:36.894
Shit.

412
00:15:36.936 --> 00:15:38.855
No. no. no.
You have to be quiet. GB.

413
00:15:38.896 --> 00:15:40.523
Shh. shh.

414
00:15:40.565 --> 00:15:42.525
Hey. be gentle with him. Relax.

415
00:15:42.567 --> 00:15:45.445
I'm simulating a full belly and
syncing it to its sleep cycle.

416
00:15:45.528 --> 00:15:47.905
I also reset our scores.
This place can eat a dick.

417
00:15:47.989 --> 00:15:51.117
What are you doing? Dishonesty
is the only way through those robots.

418
00:15:51.200 --> 00:15:52.577
I can't do that.

419
00:15:52.660 --> 00:15:54.304
so I'm putting myself
in a leprechaun trance.

420
00:15:54.328 --> 00:15:56.080
My God. why can't you just lie?

421
00:15:56.164 --> 00:15:57.874
Because then my mother wins.

422
00:16:02.253 --> 00:16:04.297
You'll never have me gold.

423
00:16:04.380 --> 00:16:06.757
I don't want your gold.
I have my own gold.

424
00:16:06.799 --> 00:16:08.426
Call it me gold.

425
00:16:08.509 --> 00:16:11.053
Fuck off. You don't
control me.

426
00:16:11.762 --> 00:16:14.140
Okay. everyone. move away
from the werewolf senator.

427
00:16:14.223 --> 00:16:16.225
Stay on this side of the room.

428
00:16:16.267 --> 00:16:17.602
Andre. you remember The Bean?

429
00:16:17.643 --> 00:16:19.937
The weird.
shiny public art installation?

430
00:16:19.979 --> 00:16:22.023
Yeah. I never got
why you liked it so much.

431
00:16:22.064 --> 00:16:23.441
Hmph.
You will after tonight.

432
00:16:23.483 --> 00:16:25.109
You two. be ready to move.

433
00:16:25.193 --> 00:16:26.670
Jessica. you sure
about these bank numbers?

434
00:16:26.694 --> 00:16:28.446
Yes. ma'am. You're
actually gonna pay them?

435
00:16:28.529 --> 00:16:30.656
They've got an EMP field
surrounding the block.

436
00:16:30.740 --> 00:16:33.951
If the wire goes through.
it means they're inside it.

437
00:16:33.993 --> 00:16:35.453
Hey! Anonymous bro!

438
00:16:35.536 --> 00:16:37.246
Don't fuck with us. Beverly.

439
00:16:37.288 --> 00:16:39.624
Okay. Fine.
Just wired it.

440
00:16:39.665 --> 00:16:41.959
Wait. Seriously?
Oh. my God!

441
00:16:42.001 --> 00:16:43.419
You realize I'm still gonna...

442
00:16:43.461 --> 00:16:45.254
Wait.
What the hell is that?

443
00:16:45.296 --> 00:16:47.423
Alright. people. do not panic!

444
00:16:47.465 --> 00:16:49.509
Inside The Bean!

445
00:16:49.592 --> 00:16:51.302
Everybody. now!
Go. go!

446
00:16:51.344 --> 00:16:54.096
You heard her! Go! Go!
Move. move. move!

447
00:16:57.892 --> 00:16:59.477
Chomps! Are you okay?

448
00:16:59.560 --> 00:17:01.020
Christ. you took a tooth for me.

449
00:17:01.103 --> 00:17:02.688
I'm alright. sir.

450
00:17:02.772 --> 00:17:04.583
My wounds are healing.
That's not a good thing. though.

451
00:17:04.607 --> 00:17:07.318
It means the human you
knew is dead. No. that zombies.

452
00:17:07.401 --> 00:17:09.153
Werewolves retain
a sense of self.

453
00:17:09.194 --> 00:17:10.738
It's just a slave
to the beast within.

454
00:17:10.820 --> 00:17:12.490
Candyman.
keep everyone safe in here

455
00:17:12.531 --> 00:17:14.325
until the cops come.
Candy-do.

456
00:17:14.407 --> 00:17:15.992
This is incredible. Bev!

457
00:17:16.035 --> 00:17:17.537
A remote-retrieval prepper den

458
00:17:17.619 --> 00:17:19.704
hidden inside
a beloved work of public art.

459
00:17:19.789 --> 00:17:22.458
Like I said...
nuance.

460
00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:24.877
You can do this.
Just be calm.

461
00:17:24.961 --> 00:17:27.588
You are a robot.
You are a robot.

462
00:17:31.092 --> 00:17:33.052
Hey. Just moving
one of our guys.

463
00:17:33.135 --> 00:17:35.221
Are you human?
Nope. Robot as they come.

464
00:17:35.304 --> 00:17:37.014
Check it out. dawg.
Cords in my head.

465
00:17:37.098 --> 00:17:39.225
Okay.
Robot enough for me.

466
00:17:39.308 --> 00:17:40.935
Holy shit. Yes!

467
00:17:41.018 --> 00:17:42.395
Stop her!

468
00:17:42.478 --> 00:17:44.522
She is not one of us!

469
00:17:45.231 --> 00:17:46.357
You are not one of us.

470
00:17:46.440 --> 00:17:47.942
What?
I'm just saying.

471
00:17:48.025 --> 00:17:50.194
this guy comes in here.
starts whining like a human.

472
00:17:50.236 --> 00:17:53.030
I am a robot.
My face is literally metal!

473
00:17:53.114 --> 00:17:54.699
So we're going by looks now?

474
00:17:54.740 --> 00:17:56.552
I heard you guys being
suspicious about a fake robot.

475
00:17:56.576 --> 00:17:59.203
This one seems emotional.
I do not trust him.

476
00:17:59.245 --> 00:18:02.415
Stop gaslighting me!
Pretty human thing to say.

477
00:18:03.249 --> 00:18:04.959
Perhaps we should kill him
to be sure.

478
00:18:05.042 --> 00:18:06.127
Okay. let's tear him apart.

479
00:18:06.210 --> 00:18:08.045
No. No! I'm a real robot!

480
00:18:08.087 --> 00:18:11.841
I don't want to die!
Aah!

481
00:18:13.759 --> 00:18:15.344
Wait. That cry.

482
00:18:15.386 --> 00:18:17.179
She's got gun baby!

483
00:18:17.221 --> 00:18:19.348
Okay. wake up.
Wake the hell up!

484
00:18:19.390 --> 00:18:20.600
Your mother is winning!

485
00:18:20.683 --> 00:18:22.727
Oh. God. that was hell!

486
00:18:22.768 --> 00:18:24.645
Can you please
just start shooting?!

487
00:18:24.729 --> 00:18:27.189
Aw. silver bullets?
Why silver?!

488
00:18:27.231 --> 00:18:28.816
Congratulations.

489
00:18:28.858 --> 00:18:31.819
You have passed the
job evaluation program.

490
00:18:31.902 --> 00:18:33.571
Wait. Where's GB?

491
00:18:36.073 --> 00:18:37.450
Thank you. Banks.

492
00:18:37.533 --> 00:18:40.202
And you. I guess you were
the prize all along.

493
00:18:40.244 --> 00:18:42.747
No. no.
no. no. no. Shh.

494
00:18:42.788 --> 00:18:45.666
I. uh...
I need you to feed it again.

495
00:18:45.750 --> 00:18:47.168
Fine.

496
00:18:50.254 --> 00:18:52.381
I am so jealous
of that connection.

497
00:18:52.423 --> 00:18:54.467
Don't be. You'll still
get all the credit.

498
00:18:54.550 --> 00:18:56.135
How you doing. Chomps?

499
00:18:56.218 --> 00:18:58.458
Ready to be a good werewolf
that fights other werewolves?

500
00:18:58.512 --> 00:19:00.097
I'd prefer to just
be myself. sir.

501
00:19:00.139 --> 00:19:02.350
Oof!
Remember. no killing.

502
00:19:02.433 --> 00:19:04.852
Arresting them at least
gives them a chance to change.

503
00:19:07.146 --> 00:19:08.981
Aah!

504
00:19:17.782 --> 00:19:18.824
Whoa! Chain gun!

505
00:19:18.908 --> 00:19:21.118
Lucky for us.
this is a pre-1985 building.

506
00:19:21.160 --> 00:19:22.453
Radiator heating is standard.

507
00:19:22.495 --> 00:19:23.621
Aah!

508
00:19:23.663 --> 00:19:25.623
Christ. the legs on these guys.

509
00:19:31.462 --> 00:19:33.798
Shit. This must be
where they filmed.

510
00:19:33.839 --> 00:19:35.299
That's far enough.

511
00:19:35.383 --> 00:19:37.802
You know. I could have run.

512
00:19:37.843 --> 00:19:40.638
but I told you
not to fuck with me!

513
00:19:40.680 --> 00:19:42.640
Look at me. You don't think
I've seen this before?

514
00:19:42.682 --> 00:19:44.975
I could make a call.
get you in the program.

515
00:19:45.017 --> 00:19:46.435
I will take you there myself.

516
00:19:46.477 --> 00:19:47.978
Are you kidding me?!
No!

517
00:19:48.062 --> 00:19:50.272
It used to be a guy gets bit.
he joins our team...

518
00:19:50.314 --> 00:19:51.674
Sir. I am succumbing

519
00:19:51.732 --> 00:19:54.068
to the darkness within.
Oh. thank Christ.

520
00:19:54.151 --> 00:19:56.237
Do it!
We are monsters. damn it!

521
00:19:57.988 --> 00:19:58.989
Oh. shit.

522
00:20:01.826 --> 00:20:03.035
Ha!

523
00:20:03.703 --> 00:20:06.497
Sorry. governor.
Crime always wins.

524
00:20:06.539 --> 00:20:08.666
Candyman. Candyman.
Candyman. Candyman. Candyman!

525
00:20:08.749 --> 00:20:11.335
Aw. man. Candyman?
Believe in me.

526
00:20:11.419 --> 00:20:13.170
Be my victim!

527
00:20:13.212 --> 00:20:15.297
Ahhhh!

528
00:20:16.799 --> 00:20:18.175
Aah! Oh!

529
00:20:18.259 --> 00:20:20.094
Cheers! Aah! Aah! Get 'em off!

530
00:20:20.177 --> 00:20:23.180
Get 'em off!
You belong to me now.

531
00:20:23.264 --> 00:20:25.433
Your death will be
a horror story

532
00:20:25.516 --> 00:20:27.393
whispered by werewolf children!

533
00:20:27.476 --> 00:20:29.019
Hey. Candyman.

534
00:20:29.103 --> 00:20:31.731
You're more than the holder.

535
00:20:31.814 --> 00:20:35.192
Sometimes I wish if
you said my name a sixth time

536
00:20:35.276 --> 00:20:37.153
I'd just disappear.

537
00:20:37.194 --> 00:20:39.029
I know. man. I know.

538
00:20:39.071 --> 00:20:40.906
Thanks.

539
00:20:45.161 --> 00:20:46.471
Pretty big crowd
out there. ma'am.

540
00:20:46.495 --> 00:20:47.723
Are you ready
to governate this bitch?

541
00:20:47.747 --> 00:20:49.540
I'll be out in a sec.
Yes. ma'am.

542
00:20:49.623 --> 00:20:51.041
Pretty amazing. governor.

543
00:20:51.125 --> 00:20:53.544
Defanging a werewolf syndicate
on night one?

544
00:20:53.586 --> 00:20:56.714
Not bad. I'm sure the press
will love hearing you say that.

545
00:20:56.797 --> 00:20:59.383
Nah. I'm gonna
take a back exit.

546
00:20:59.425 --> 00:21:01.719
It's your night. Bev.

547
00:21:01.802 --> 00:21:03.179
Thanks. Andre.

548
00:21:03.220 --> 00:21:05.389
Hey. can I ask you something?

549
00:21:05.473 --> 00:21:07.141
If I wasn't president.

550
00:21:07.183 --> 00:21:10.144
if I gave it all up.
could this work?

551
00:21:10.227 --> 00:21:12.062
If you weren't president.

552
00:21:12.104 --> 00:21:13.814
who would you be?

553
00:21:13.898 --> 00:21:15.608
See you around. Andre.

554
00:21:18.235 --> 00:21:19.904
Come on. Chomps.
Let's go home.

555
00:21:19.987 --> 00:21:21.822
You know. when
they reassigned me to you.

556
00:21:21.906 --> 00:21:23.741
I didn't think I'd end up
a wolf creature

557
00:21:23.783 --> 00:21:25.451
ineligible for retirement.

558
00:21:25.534 --> 00:21:28.204
Hey. no. I'll get
my best people on this.

559
00:21:28.245 --> 00:21:29.765
Could we stop at the park
on the way home?

560
00:21:29.789 --> 00:21:31.415
No. but I do have
a treat in the car.

561
00:21:31.499 --> 00:21:32.625
How about some candy?

562
00:21:32.708 --> 00:21:33.751
Ooh!

563
00:21:35.628 --> 00:21:39.965
♪ Werewolves stepping over
boundaries ♪

564
00:21:40.049 --> 00:21:42.593
♪ With my ex-wife ♪

565
00:21:42.676 --> 00:21:46.597
♪ Candyman can be a good guy ♪

566
00:21:46.639 --> 00:21:51.143
♪ If you give him
room to grow ♪

567
00:21:51.227 --> 00:21:53.354
♪ Werewolves. zero ♪

568
00:21:53.437 --> 00:21:57.942
♪ President. 100 ♪

569
00:21:58.901 --> 00:22:01.320
Chomps. buddy.
how are you holding up?

570
00:22:01.403 --> 00:22:03.364
I'm infected
with lycanthropy. sir.

571
00:22:03.447 --> 00:22:04.782
Are you now?
Dr. Finch.

572
00:22:04.865 --> 00:22:06.909
Y-Hello!
It's called a moon collar.

573
00:22:06.951 --> 00:22:08.869
It delivers a drip
of silver serum

574
00:22:08.953 --> 00:22:11.872
that allows you to control
when you werewolf-hulk out.

575
00:22:11.956 --> 00:22:13.916
So it's a cure?
It's a start.

576
00:22:13.958 --> 00:22:16.794
And I just heard that under
paranormal agent guidelines.

577
00:22:16.836 --> 00:22:19.421
you won't have to retire
for another 35 years

578
00:22:19.463 --> 00:22:21.465
since they now calculate
your age in dog years.

579
00:22:21.507 --> 00:22:23.008
35 years?

580
00:22:23.092 --> 00:22:25.970
I know! Great. right?
Stay strong. Alan Chomps!

581
00:22:26.053 --> 00:22:27.638
America loves you.

582
00:22:27.721 --> 00:22:29.265
Good girl. boo-boo.

583
00:22:29.306 --> 00:22:30.975
Did you get any of that?

583
00:22:31.305 --> 00:23:31.588
Do you want subtitles for any video?
